flowchart TD

    %% ============================
    %% Start
    %% ============================
    A([Start]) --> B[Launch Windows 11]

    B --> C[Open Podman Desktop]
    C --> D[Start dev-box-vscode]

    %% ============================
    %% VS Code Connection
    %% ============================
    D --> E[Connect via VS Code<br>(SSH or Browser)]
    E --> F[Open a Folder in VS Code]

    %% ============================
    %% Project Detection
    %% ============================
    F --> G{Which folder<br>did the user open?}

    G -->|Java project| H[java-project folder]
    G -->|.NET project| I[dotnet-project folder]
    G -->|AI Sandbox| J[ai-sandbox folder]
    G -->|Other| K[Generic folder<br>(no Dev Container)]

    %% ============================
    %% Dev Container Startup
    %% ============================
    H --> L[VS Code detects .devcontainer]
    I --> L
    J --> L

    L --> M[Inner Podman starts matching Dev Container]

    M -->|Java| N[java-dev container]
    M -->|.NET| O[dotnet-dev container]
    M -->|AI Sandbox| P[ai-sandbox-dev container]

    %% ============================
    %% Model Container Logic
    %% ============================
    P --> Q{Start model containers?}

    Q -->|Yes| R[Start ollama / lmstudio / openai-compatible servers]
    Q -->|No| S[AI Sandbox ready]

    R --> S

    %% ============================
    %% Active Development
    %% ============================
    N --> T[Active Development]
    O --> T
    S --> T

    T --> U([End])
